  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've found a public avatar that I really like and I want to contact the author to offer to buy the project and pay a good fee for it. The best I can do is send them a friend request without any information about why I'm trying to friend them. My suggestion is to create a way that authors of worlds and avatars could opt into or opt out of to allow users who are not their friends to send the messages. Such messages would be sorted separately so that they wouldn't interfere or hide messages from the authors friends.",
